---
import Root from '#/layout/root.astro'
import CaseStudyGrid from '#/components/case-study-grid.astro'
import Portrait from '#/components/portrait.astro'
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
---

<Root>
  <h1>
    Web developer who loves building websites for{' '}
    <span class="highlight">humans</span>
  </h1>
  <section class="hero with-sidebar">
    <div class="flow">
      <p class="text-lg">
        Hi! 👋 I'm D. R. Branch, a web developer currently based on the South
        Coast of the UK.
      </p>
      <p>
        I started working with the web at the tender age of 13 making websites
        to host my serious literature.<sup>*</sup> I had some detours into
        hardware design and teaching, but have since returned to the web (if I
        ever really left).
      </p>
      <p>
        Suffice to say, I've been thinking about computers and the web for{' '}
        <em>most of my life</em>, and I believe it's one of the best
        communication platforms we've got. I want to help make it work for as
        many people as possible.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I'm not at work shuffling bytes around, you can find me living with
        my husband and our cat, playing the piano, or wandering besides the sea.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm">* Nintendo fanfiction</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar" data-center>
      <Portrait />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="flow">
    <h2>Case Studies</h2>
    <CaseStudyGrid />
  </section>
</Root>
